ARNO 3.0 for "Ark Nova - Complete Scripted" (Tabletop Simulator)

This product includes software ported from:

  Ark Nova Solo Helper
  https://github.com/brdgm/ark-nova-solo-helper
  Copyright Stefan Seifert
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

  The ARNO decision logic in arno/core/ (card slots, action tables, slot draw,
  conservation project module tracker, and the dice of the helper's components) is a
  Lua port of that TypeScript code. Modifications: translated to Lua for MoonSharp /
  Tabletop Simulator; randomness replaced by a seeded generator; component dice moved
  into pure functions. arno/core/cards_data.lua is generated from src/services/Cards.ts.

  The test harness in tests/harness/ runs the unmodified helper code as a reference.

A.R.N.O. 3.0, unofficial solo mode for Ark Nova:
  designed by Andre K.,
  https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/2823056/rno-alternative-solo-mode

